<p>Consuming a void star, you use it to summon a void monolith at the targeted location for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 6, 7</acronym> turns. The monolith is very durable, and while immobile it will attempt to daze enemies within radius 1 for 2 turns every half a turn using your spellpower.</p><p>The monolith will gain <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Magic 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">1, 1, 2, 3, 4</acronym> life rating and <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Magic 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">15%, 21%, 29%, 35%, 39%</acronym> all resist based on your Magic stat.</p>